<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy | AdBoost Health" description="How AdBoost Health collects, uses, and protects your information." canonicalPath="/privacy/">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: July 4, 2026</em></p>

  <p>AdBoost Health ("we", "us") operates <a href="https://www.adboost.health/">www.adboost.health</a>. This policy describes what information we collect, why, and how it's handled.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Booking information.</strong> When you book a strategy call, scheduling is handled by Cal.com. We receive the name, email address, and any notes you submit through that flow. Cal.com's own <a href="https://cal.com/privacy" rel="noopener">privacy policy</a> governs their processing.</li>
    <li><strong>Email.</strong> If you email hello@adboost.health, we retain that correspondence.</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data.</strong> Our host (Vercel) processes standard server logs (IP address, user agent) to serve and secure the site. We do not run advertising trackers or sell personal data.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To schedule and prepare for calls you request</li>
    <li>To respond to inquiries</li>
    <li>To operate and secure the website</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We don't sell personal information. Data is shared only with the service providers named above (Cal.com for scheduling, Vercel for hosting) as needed to operate the site.</p>

  <h2>Retention & your rights</h2>
  <p>We keep booking and correspondence records only as long as needed for the purposes above. To access, correct, or delete your information, email <a href="mailto:hello@adboost.health">hello@adboost.health</a>. Canadian residents have rights under PIPEDA; we honor equivalent requests from any jurisdiction.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This site does not set first-party tracking cookies. Embedded services (Cal.com) may set cookies necessary for their scheduling functionality when you interact with them.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>AdBoost Health · Toronto, Canada · <a href="mailto:hello@adboost.health">hello@adboost.health</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
